decision_conditions:
Condition : 3 - Detailed drawings or samples of materials, as appropriate, in respect of the following, shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority in writing prior to commencement of the work:

(a)	hip/ridge materials/construction;
(b)	construction details of the dormer windows including relationships with the change in roof pitch;
(c)	the balcony railings;
(d)	the material and profiles of rainwater goods;
(e)	the lead cladding;
(f)	gable copings;
(g)	valley gutter details;
(h)	rainwater hopper constructions;
(i)	finish-material of the flat roof-area; and
(j)	windows and all other new joinery, including cross section drawings to 1:10 scale.

Such details shall be implemented only in accordance with the drawings as approved.
